<title>USA: AmeriSource Health completes Walker buy.</title>
<headline>AmeriSource Health completes Walker buy.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriSource Health Corp said it completed the acquisition of Walker Drug Co of Birmingham, Ala., for about $140 million in cash including the assumption of debt.</p>
<p>AmeriSource said the acquisition will be funded by additional borrowings under the company's revolving credit facility.</p>
<p>Walker is a full-service wholesale pharmaceutical distributor with annualized revenues of about $800 million.</p>
</text>
